state
bin
pw-executor/node_modules
pw-executor/dist
.claude
deploy
# Bundle only the static web assets (setup-WebUI + calculators + their authoritative doc) into the
# image for local/air-gapped use (docker compose --profile webui); exclude the heavy prose docs.
docs/**
!docs/setup/**
!docs/calculators/**
!docs/chat/**
!docs/index.html
!docs/index.md
!docs/_config.yml
!docs/LOCAL_MODELS.md
# ADR-064: the go:embed manifest — control-api compiles `package webui` (docs/embed.go), so the
# Go build inside the image needs it (and every file its patterns name; chat/ fixed above — it was
# missing from the bundle entirely, so the webui profile's /chat/ 404'd. KEEP IN SYNC with embed.go).
!docs/embed.go
# data files the bundled pages fetch at runtime: the setup wizard's runtime presets (M11.5 PR-4) and the
# hub's live-pricing seeds. Without these the `webui` profile serves pages whose fetch() 404s.
!docs/backend-presets.json
!docs/prices.json
memory
**/__pycache__
